Third-party data

The Shuangpin key tables in src/schemes.cjs are derived from the Rime input
method engine's official schemas (double_pinyin_flypy, double_pinyin,
double_pinyin_mspy, double_pinyin_abc, double_pinyin_pyjj), which are
distributed under the Apache License 2.0. Only the key mapping rules are
transcribed; no Rime code is included.

The character/pinyin table in src/dict-src.txt is a common 3755-character
list of standard Chinese characters with Hanyu Pinyin romanisation.
